  unitName: Burny
  unitId: 10030
  unitNumber: 43
  description: Allegedly born from lava, this liquid-type demon radiates heat from
    its body. The lowest ranked of the demons, it is said to be the perfect sparring
    partner for new summoners. It prefers fiery places, but lacks a specific habitat.
    It causes fire when it appears, troubling those who come across it. Many Summoners
    choose it due to its cute appearance.
  summonDesc: '*Sizzle* Let''s go!<br>*Sizzle* Leave it to Burny!'
  fusionDesc: '*Sizzle* I got stronger!<br>Hmm? *Sizzle* Did it just<br>get hotter!?'
